|motes = 10
}}

== Behavior ==
'''Oubliette Guards''' are passive until a player damages them. When hostile, they move towards the player and take {{Stat|rt|5}} from the player on contact. Once all '''Oubliette Guards''' are defeated, a message will appear in chat, saying:{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&eAll the guards have been defeated, you are free to go!}}}}

The entrance to the {{zone|Oubliette}} will then fall, and allow the player to escape.

